# Write Playwright E2E Tests for CVA Components

## Objective
Write automated Playwright E2E tests for the CVA refactored components.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Inject DOM nodes with exact CVA variant class combinations using page.evaluate().
- [ ] Verify computed CSS styles match the expected tactical aesthetic.
- [ ] Ensure all CVA components (TacticalPanelCard, TacticalButtonBadge, TacticalInputs) are covered.
